      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kemp%2C_Oklahoma"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Before the railroad arrived, Kemp served as a trade center for prime agricultural land producing large crops of cotton and corn.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
